Subject: [PATCH] mtd: call register_mtd_blktrans_devs only when it is built

OpenWrt's patch calls register_mtd_blktrans_devs() from the MTD core
unconditionally, which fails to link with MTD_BLKDEVS=n.

--- a/drivers/mtd/mtdcore.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/mtdcore.c
@@ -1179,7 +1179,8 @@
 		register_reboot_notifier(&mtd->reboot_notifier);
 	}
 
-	register_mtd_blktrans_devs();
+	if (IS_REACHABLE(CONFIG_MTD_BLKDEVS))
+		register_mtd_blktrans_devs();
 
 out:
 	if (ret) {
